n\n{{Recipe}}\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n=== Rice ===\n* 5½ [[Cookbook:Tbsp|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Canola Oil|canola oil]]\n* 5 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]]\n* 1 big [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], [[Cookbook:Slicing|sliced]]\n* 2 green [[Cookbook:Chiles|chiles]], sliced\n* 4 [[Cookbook:Chicken|chicken fillet]], minced\n* 150 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] [[Cookbook:Prawn|prawn]], skin removed\n* ½ can button [[Cookbook:Mushroom|mushrooms]]\n* ½ pack enoki mushrooms\n* ½ pack shiitake mushrooms, washed and sliced\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] (700 g) cooked [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Oyster sauce|oyster sauce]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Dehydrated Broth|chicken powder]]\n* 1½ tbsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1½ tbsp [[Cookbook:Hoisin Sauce|hoisin sauce]]\n\n=== Garnish ===\n* [[Cookbook:Lettuce|Lettuce]]\n* [[Cookbook:Pickle|Pickles]]\n* [[Cookbook:Tomato|Tomato]]\n* [[Cookbook:Cucumber|Cucumber]]\n* Shrimp crackers\n* [[Cookbook:Chili Paste|Chilli sauce]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Heat the oil in a [[Cookbook:Non-stick|non-stick]] pan, and [[Cookbook:Frying|fry]] the garlic and big onion until fragrant.\n# Add the prawn and minced chicken fillet. [[Cookbook:Stir-frying|Stir fry]] until the prawn and the chicken change color.\n# Add the button mushroom, enoki mushroom, and shitake mushroom. Then, add the rice together with oyster sauce, chicken powder, salt, and hoisin sauce.\n# Serve hot with garnishes.\n[[Category:Recipes for fried rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using common mushroom]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chicken]]\n[[Category:Recipes using shrimp]]\n[[Category:Recipes using oyster sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hoisin sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lettuce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tomato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile paste and sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using canola o